<title>USA: Tuboscope connection inspection unit.</title>
<headline>Tuboscope connection inspection unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuboscope Inc said Thursday it has acquired the operating assets of Gator Hawk Inc, a Houston-based provider of inspection services for tubular oilfield connections, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Tuboscope is the world's leading supplier of oilfield internal tubular coating and tubular inspection services.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
